            "name": "query - Security Incident Summary"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### 🚨 Security Incident Summary\r\n\r\nProvides a workspace-level view of Microsoft Sentinel incidents across the selected workspaces.\r\n\r\nIncident counts use the **latest known state of each incident** and include incidents **created during the selected Time Range**. The global **Severity, Product and Owner** selections are applied to this view.\r\n\r\n- **Customer** — Customer context resolved from Azure Lighthouse where a matching workspace delegation is available; otherwise the full Azure subscription name is shown.\r\n- **Lighthouse** — **Yes** means a Lighthouse delegation was found that directly covers the Sentinel workspace subscription or resource group. **Unknown** means a matching delegation could not be established from the available Azure Resource Graph data; it does not mean that no Lighthouse relationship exists for the customer.\r\n- **P1–P4** — Incident counts by Microsoft Sentinel severity.\r\n- **Total** — Total incidents in the selected incident population.\r\n- **Last Incident** — Time since the most recently created incident in the selected period.\r\n- **Median First Action** — Median time from incident creation to its first recorded modification.\r\n- **Median Close** — Median time from incident creation to closure for closed incidents.\r\n- **Incident Trend** — Incident creation activity across the selected Time Range.\r\n\r\n💡 **Customer and Lighthouse describe different things.** Customer identifies the environment using the best available context. Lighthouse indicates whether the **Sentinel workspace itself** can be matched to a direct Lighthouse delegation. A customer can therefore have a Lighthouse relationship elsewhere while this column shows **Unknown**."
            },
            "name": "text - 11"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\r\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.insights/workbooks\"\r\n| where properties.displayName has \"Security operations efficiency\"\r\n| project\r\n    id,\r\n    note = \"Subscription and Workspace may need to be selected again in the opened workbook.\"\r\n| limit 1",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "Open [Security Operations Efficiency] Workbook - if the Workbook exists locally?",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ]
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "exportworkSpacename",
              "comparison": "isNotEqualTo"
            },
            "name": "query - open_SOC_workbook"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\r\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces\"\r\n| project\r\n    id,\r\n    name = tolower(name),\r\n    subscriptionId,\r\n    tenantId,\r\n    resourceGroup\r\n| join kind=inner\r\n(\r\n    resources\r\n    | where type =~ \"microsoft.operationsmanagement/solutions\"\r\n    | where name has \"SecurityInsights\"\r\n    | parse name with * \"(\" SentinelWorkspace \")\" *\r\n    | project name = tolower(SentinelWorkspace), location\r\n)\r\non name\r\n| where name =~ \"{exportworkSpacename}\"\r\n| project\r\n    name,\r\n    Region = location,\r\n    resourceGroup,\r\n    subscriptionId,\r\n    tenantId,\r\n    Open = tolower(id)",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "🏢 Workspace Details — {exportworkSpacename}",
              "exportedParameters": [
                {
                  "fieldName": "tenantId",
                  "parameterName": "exporttenantId",
                  "parameterType": 1
                },
                {
                  "fieldName": "subscriptionId",
                  "parameterName": "exportSubscriptionId",
                  "parameterType": 1
                },
                {
                  "fieldName": "resourceGroup",
                  "parameterName": "exportResourceGroup",
                  "parameterType": 1
                },
                {
                  "fieldName": "name",
                  "parameterName": "exportName",
                  "parameterType": 1
                }
              ],
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ]
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "exportworkSpacename",
              "comparison": "isNotEqualTo"
            },
            "name": "query - Workspace Details"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "{\"version\":\"ARMEndpoint/1.0\",\"data\":null,\"headers\":[],\"method\":\"GET\",\"path\":\"/tenants\",\"urlParams\":[{\"key\":\"api-version\",\"value\":\"2022-12-01\"}],\"batchDisabled\":false,\"transformers\":[{\"type\":\"jsonpath\",\"settings\":{\"tablePath\":\"$.value\",\"columns\":[{\"path\":\"$.id\",\"columnid\":\"id\"},{\"path\":\"$.tenantId\",\"columnid\":\"tenantId\"},{\"path\":\"$.displayName\",\"columnid\":\"displayName\"},{\"path\":\"$.defaultDomain\",\"columnid\":\"defaultDomain\"},{\"path\":\"$.countryCode\",\"columnid\":\"countryCode\"},{\"path\":\"$.tenantType\",\"columnid\":\"tenantType\"},{\"path\":\"$.tenantCategory\",\"columnid\":\"tenantCategory\"},{\"path\":\"$.domains\",\"columnid\":\"domains\"},{\"path\":\"$.tenantBrandingLogoUrl\",\"columnid\":\"tenantBrandingLogoUrl\"}]}}]}",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "🏢 Accessible Tenant Directory — {$rowCount} tenants",
              "queryType": 12
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "exportworkSpacename",
              "comparison": "isEqualTo",
              "value": "hide"
            },
            "name": "query - Tenant Details"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "{\"version\":\"ARMEndpoint/1.0\",\"data\":null,\"headers\":[],\"method\":\"GET\",\"path\":\"/subscriptions/{exportSubscriptionId}/resourceGroups/{exportResourceGroup}/providers/Microsoft.OperationalInsights/workspaces/{exportworkSpacename}/providers/Microsoft.SecurityInsights/alertRules\",\"urlParams\":[{\"key\":\"api-version\",\"value\":\"2024-03-01\"}],\"batchDisabled\":false,\"transformers\":[{\"type\":\"jsonpath\",\"settings\":{\"tablePath\":\"$.value\",\"columns\":[]}}]}",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "📐 Analytics Rules — {exportworkSpacename} — {$rowCount} deployed",
              "showExportToExcel": true,
              "queryType": 12
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
