    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "title": "🌐 Azure Lighthouse",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### 📋 Azure Lighthouse Registrations\r\n\r\nThis report shows the **Azure Lighthouse registration assignments visible to Sentinel Central**, including the exact Azure scope to which each registration applies.\r\n\r\nUse **Search** to find a customer, registration name, resource group, managing organisation, or user.\r\n\r\n- **Customer Directory** — The managee tenant/directory name reported by Azure Lighthouse. This may not be the operational customer name.\r\n- **Registration** — The Lighthouse registration definition name. This often contains the most useful customer or service context.\r\n- **Scope** — Indicates whether the delegation applies to an entire **Subscription** or a specific **Resource Group**.\r\n- **Delegated Resource** — The subscription ID or resource group actually covered by the Lighthouse registration.\r\n- **Managed By** — The managing tenant/name reported by the registration.\r\n- **Assignments** — Number of registration assignments represented by the row.\r\n- **Status** — Current provisioning state of the registration.\r\n- **Created / Last Modified** — Registration lifecycle timestamps.\r\n\r\n> 💡 **Important:** A customer may have an Azure Lighthouse registration without their Microsoft Sentinel workspace itself being directly delegated. For example, a registration may cover a separate integration resource group or subscription. Therefore, absence from **Sentinel Workspaces with Direct Lighthouse Delegation** does not necessarily mean that no Lighthouse relationship exists for that customer."
            },
            "name": "text - 4"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "// ======================================================================\r\n// Sentinel Central - Lighthouse & Sentinel Workspace Coverage\r\n//\r\n// Shows Sentinel-enabled workspaces in subscriptions visible through\r\n// Azure Lighthouse.\r\n// ======================================================================\r\n\r\nresources\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// SENTINEL-ENABLED WORKSPACES\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.operationsmanagement/solutions\"\r\n| where name has \"SecurityInsights\"\r\n\r\n| parse name with * \"(\" SentinelWorkspace \")\" *\r\n\r\n| project\r\n    Workspace = tolower(SentinelWorkspace),\r\n    Region = location,\r\n    subscriptionId,\r\n    ResourceGroup = resourceGroup\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// AZURE LIGHTHOUSE REGISTRATIONS\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| join kind=inner\r\n(\r\n    ManagedServicesResources\r\n\r\n    | where type =~ \"microsoft.managedservices/registrationassignments\"\r\n\r\n    | extend\r\n        Directory =\r\n            tostring(\r\n                properties.registrationDefinition.properties.manageeTenantName\r\n            ),\r\n\r\n        ManagedBy =\r\n            tostring(\r\n                properties.registrationDefinition.properties.managedByTenantName\r\n            ),\r\n\r\n        ProvisioningState =\r\n            tostring(\r\n                properties.registrationDefinition.properties.provisioningState\r\n            )\r\n\r\n    | where isnotempty(Directory)\r\n\r\n    | project\r\n        subscriptionId,\r\n        Directory,\r\n        ManagedBy,\r\n        ProvisioningState\r\n)\r\non subscriptionId\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// REMOVE DUPLICATES\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| summarize\r\n    ManagedBy = any(ManagedBy),\r\n    ProvisioningState = any(ProvisioningState)\r\n  by\r\n    Directory,\r\n    Workspace,\r\n    Region,\r\n    ResourceGroup,\r\n    subscriptionId\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// FINAL OUTPUT\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| project\r\n    Directory,\r\n    Workspace,\r\n    Region,\r\n    ResourceGroup,\r\n    ManagedBy,\r\n    ProvisioningState\r\n\r\n| order by\r\n    Directory asc,\r\n    Workspace asc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "🌐 Sentinel Workspaces with Direct Lighthouse Delegation — {$rowCount} workspaces",
              "showExportToExcel": true,
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Directory",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "220px"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Workspace",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "220px"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Region",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "120px"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ResourceGroup",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "200px"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ManagedBy",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "200px"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ProvisioningState",
                    "formatter": 18,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                      "thresholdsGrid": [
                        {
                          "operator": "==",
                          "thresholdValue": "Succeeded",
                          "representation": "success",
                          "text": "Succeeded"
                        },
                        {
                          "operator": "==",
                          "thresholdValue": "Failed",
                          "representation": "critical",
                          "text": "Failed"
                        },
                        {
                          "operator": "Default",
                          "thresholdValue": null,
                          "representation": "Blank",
                          "text": "{0}"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Open",
                    "formatter": 7,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "linkTarget": "Resource",
                      "linkLabel": "Open Workspace",
                      "linkIsContextBlade": true
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "rowLimit": 2000,
                "filter": true,
                "hierarchySettings": {
                  "treeType": 1,
                  "groupBy": [
                    "Directory"
                  ],
                  "expandTopLevel": true
                },
                "sortBy": [
                  {
                    "itemKey": "Directory",
                    "sortOrder": 1
                  }
                ],
                "labelSettings": [
                  {
                    "columnId": "Directory",
                    "label": "Customer Directory"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "Workspace",
                    "label": "Workspace"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "Region",
                    "label": "Region"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "ResourceGroup",
                    "label": "Resource Group"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "ManagedBy",
                    "label": "Managed By"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "ProvisioningState",
                    "label": "Status"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "sortBy": [
                {
                  "itemKey": "Directory",
                  "sortOrder": 1
                }
              ]
            },
            "name": "query - Lighthouse Sentinel Coverage"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "Sentinel-enabled workspaces where an Azure Lighthouse registration directly covers the workspace subscription or resource group.\r\n\r\n💡 **Direct workspace delegation vs customer registration:** The workspace coverage report above shows Sentinel workspaces where a Lighthouse registration directly covers the workspace subscription or resource group. The registration report below shows the broader Lighthouse registration inventory and may therefore contain customer relationships that do not appear in the workspace coverage report."
            },
            "name": "text - Lighthouse Coverage Guidance"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "// ======================================================================\r\n// Sentinel Central - Azure Lighthouse Registrations\r\n//\r\n// Shows Azure Lighthouse registration lifecycle and delegation scope.\r\n// Customer Directory and Registration are deliberately kept separate.\r\n// ======================================================================\r\n\r\nManagedServicesResources\r\n\r\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.managedservices/registrationassignments\"\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// REGISTRATION DETAILS\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend RegistrationResourceId = tolower(id)\r\n\r\n| extend Directory =\r\n    coalesce(\r\n        tostring(properties.registrationDefinition.properties.manageeTenantName),\r\n        tostring(properties.manageeTenantName)\r\n    )\r\n\r\n| extend Registration =\r\n    tostring(properties.registrationDefinition.properties.registrationDefinitionName)\r\n\r\n| extend ManagedBy =\r\n    tostring(properties.registrationDefinition.properties.managedByTenantName)\r\n\r\n| extend ProvisioningState =\r\n    tostring(properties.registrationDefinition.properties.provisioningState)\r\n\r\n| extend Created = todatetime(systemData.createdAt)\r\n| extend LastModified = todatetime(systemData.lastModifiedAt)\r\n| extend LastModifiedBy = tostring(systemData.lastModifiedBy)\r\n\r\n| where isnotempty(Directory)\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// DELEGATION SCOPE\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend DelegatedSubscriptionId =\r\n    extract(\r\n        @\"/subscriptions/([^/]+)\",\r\n        1,\r\n        RegistrationResourceId\r\n    )\r\n\r\n| extend DelegatedResourceGroup =\r\n    extract(\r\n        @\"/resourcegroups/([^/]+)\",\r\n        1,\r\n        RegistrationResourceId\r\n    )\r\n\r\n| extend Scope =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isnotempty(DelegatedResourceGroup),\r\n        \"Resource Group\",\r\n        \"Subscription\"\r\n    )\r\n\r\n| extend DelegatedResource =\r\n    iff(\r\n        Scope == \"Resource Group\",\r\n        DelegatedResourceGroup,\r\n        DelegatedSubscriptionId\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// DISPLAY FALLBACKS\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend Registration =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isempty(Registration),\r\n        \"Not reported\",\r\n        Registration\r\n    )\r\n\r\n| extend ManagedBy =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isempty(ManagedBy),\r\n        \"Not reported\",\r\n        ManagedBy\r\n    )\r\n\r\n| extend ProvisioningState =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isempty(ProvisioningState),\r\n        \"Unknown\",\r\n        ProvisioningState\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// ONE ROW PER REGISTRATION / DELEGATED SCOPE\r\n//\r\n// A single arg_max keeps ManagedBy, Status and LastModifiedBy attached\r\n// to the same latest registration assignment record.\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| summarize\r\n    Assignments = count(),\r\n    Created = min(Created),\r\n    arg_max(\r\n        LastModified,\r\n        ManagedBy,\r\n        ProvisioningState,\r\n        LastModifiedBy\r\n    )\r\n  by\r\n    Directory,\r\n    Registration,\r\n    Scope,\r\n    DelegatedResource\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// FINAL OUTPUT\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| project\r\n    Directory,\r\n    Registration,\r\n    Scope,\r\n    DelegatedResource,\r\n    ManagedBy,\r\n    Assignments,\r\n    ProvisioningState,\r\n    Created,\r\n    LastModified,\r\n    LastModifiedBy\r\n\r\n| order by Directory asc, Registration asc, LastModified desc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "📋 Azure Lighthouse Registrations — {$rowCount} registration scopes",
              "showExportToExcel": true,
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Directory",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "220px"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Registration",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "320px"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Scope",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "130px"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "DelegatedResource",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "240px"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ManagedBy",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "220px"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Assignments",
                    "formatter": 8,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "whiteBlack",
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "100px"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "ProvisioningState",
                    "formatter": 18,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                      "thresholdsGrid": [
                        {
                          "operator": "==",
                          "thresholdValue": "Succeeded",
                          "representation": "success",
                          "text": "Succeeded"
                        },
                        {
                          "operator": "==",
                          "thresholdValue": "Failed",
                          "representation": "critical",
                          "text": "Failed"
                        },
                        {
                          "operator": "Default",
                          "thresholdValue": null,
                          "representation": "Blank",
                          "text": "{0}"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Created",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "190px"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "LastModified",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "190px"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "LastModifiedBy",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "260px"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "rowLimit": 5000,
                "filter": true,
                "hierarchySettings": {
                  "treeType": 1,
                  "groupBy": [
                    "Directory"
                  ],
                  "expandTopLevel": true
                },
                "sortBy": [
                  {
                    "itemKey": "LastModified",
                    "sortOrder": 2
                  }
                ],
                "labelSettings": [
                  {
                    "columnId": "Directory",
                    "label": "Customer Directory"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "Registration",
                    "label": "Registration"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "Scope",
                    "label": "Scope"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "DelegatedResource",
                    "label": "Delegated Resource"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "ManagedBy",
                    "label": "Managed By"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "Assignments",
                    "label": "Assignments"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "ProvisioningState",
                    "label": "Status"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "Created",
                    "label": "Created"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "LastModified",
                    "label": "Last Modified"
                  },
                  {
                    "columnId": "LastModifiedBy",
                    "label": "Last Modified By"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "sortBy": [
                {
                  "itemKey": "LastModified",
                  "sortOrder": 2
                }
              ]
            },
            "name": "query - Lighthouse Registrations"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "Azure Lighthouse registration lifecycle information visible to the managing tenant. Created shows the earliest observed registration assignment for the customer directory; Last Modified reflects the most recently modified assignment."
            },
            "name": "text - Lighthouse Registration Guidance"
          }
        ]
      },
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "selectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "lighthouse"
      },
      "name": "group - Azure Lighthouse"
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "title": "🔎 Latency Investigation",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "// ======================================================================\r\n// Sentinel Central - Latency Workspace Customer Context\r\n//\r\n// Customer precedence:\r\n//   1. Matching Lighthouse directory/customer\r\n//   2. Full Azure subscription name\r\n//   3. Unresolved\r\n//\r\n// WorkspaceResourceId is retained for downstream Log Analytics scoping.\r\n// ======================================================================\r\n\r\nresources\r\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces\"\r\n\r\n| extend workspaceResourceIdLower = tolower(id)\r\n\r\n| project\r\n    Workspace = tolower(name),\r\n    WorkspaceResourceId = id,\r\n    workspaceResourceIdLower,\r\n    subscriptionId,\r\n    resourceGroup,\r\n    resourceGroupLower = tolower(resourceGroup),\r\n    location,\r\n    tenantId\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// SENTINEL ENABLEMENT\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| join kind=inner\r\n(\r\n    resources\r\n    | where type =~ \"microsoft.operationsmanagement/solutions\"\r\n    | where name has \"SecurityInsights\"\r\n    | extend linkedWorkspaceResourceId =\r\n        tolower(tostring(properties.workspaceResourceId))\r\n    | project linkedWorkspaceResourceId\r\n)\r\non $left.workspaceResourceIdLower == $right.linkedWorkspaceResourceId\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// SUBSCRIPTION NAME\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| join kind=leftouter\r\n(\r\n    ResourceContainers\r\n    | where type =~ \"microsoft.resources/subscriptions\"\r\n    | project\r\n        subscriptionId,\r\n        SubscriptionName = name\r\n)\r\non subscriptionId\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// AZURE LIGHTHOUSE REGISTRATIONS\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| join kind=leftouter\r\n(\r\n    ManagedServicesResources\r\n    | where type =~ \"microsoft.managedservices/registrationassignments\"\r\n\r\n    | extend RegistrationResourceId = tolower(id)\r\n\r\n    | extend LighthouseDirectory =\r\n        coalesce(\r\n            tostring(properties.registrationDefinition.properties.manageeTenantName),\r\n            tostring(properties.manageeTenantName)\r\n        )\r\n\r\n    | extend DelegatedSubscriptionId =\r\n        extract(\r\n            @\"/subscriptions/([^/]+)\",\r\n            1,\r\n            RegistrationResourceId\r\n        )\r\n\r\n    | extend DelegatedResourceGroup =\r\n        extract(\r\n            @\"/resourcegroups/([^/]+)\",\r\n            1,\r\n            RegistrationResourceId\r\n        )\r\n\r\n    | extend ScopeType =\r\n        iff(\r\n            isnotempty(DelegatedResourceGroup),\r\n            \"Resource Group\",\r\n            \"Subscription\"\r\n        )\r\n\r\n    | where isnotempty(LighthouseDirectory)\r\n\r\n    | project\r\n        subscriptionId = DelegatedSubscriptionId,\r\n        LighthouseDirectory,\r\n        DelegatedResourceGroup = tolower(DelegatedResourceGroup),\r\n        ScopeType\r\n)\r\non subscriptionId\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// DIRECT WORKSPACE LIGHTHOUSE MATCH\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend LighthouseMatch =\r\n    case(\r\n        ScopeType == \"Resource Group\"\r\n            and DelegatedResourceGroup == resourceGroupLower, 2,\r\n        ScopeType == \"Subscription\", 1,\r\n        0\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// ONE ROW PER WORKSPACE\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| summarize\r\n    LighthouseMatch = max(LighthouseMatch),\r\n    LighthouseDirectory = anyif(LighthouseDirectory, LighthouseMatch > 0),\r\n    SubscriptionName = any(SubscriptionName),\r\n    WorkspaceResourceId = any(WorkspaceResourceId),\r\n    subscriptionId = any(subscriptionId),\r\n    resourceGroup = any(resourceGroup),\r\n    location = any(location),\r\n    tenantId = any(tenantId)\r\n  by Workspace\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// CUSTOMER\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend Customer =\r\n    case(\r\n        LighthouseMatch > 0 and isnotempty(LighthouseDirectory),\r\n            LighthouseDirectory,\r\n        isnotempty(SubscriptionName),\r\n            SubscriptionName,\r\n        \"Unresolved\"\r\n    )\r\n\r\n| project\r\n    Workspace,\r\n    Customer,\r\n    WorkspaceResourceId,\r\n    subscriptionId,\r\n    resourceGroup,\r\n    location,\r\n    tenantId",
              "size": 0,
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ]
            },
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "hide",
              "comparison": "isEqualTo",
              "value": "hide"
            },
            "name": "query - Latency Customer Context"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "// ======================================================================\r\n// Sentinel Central - Incident Ingestion / Processing Latency\r\n//\r\n// Purpose:\r\n// Identify processing and ingestion delays associated with incidents.\r\n//\r\n// For incidents containing multiple alerts, latency values represent\r\n// the WORST associated alert so processing outliers remain visible.\r\n// ======================================================================\r\n\r\nlet Incidents =\r\n    SecurityIncident\r\n\r\n    | summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by TenantId, IncidentNumber\r\n\r\n    | where CreatedTime >= {TimeRange:start}\r\n        and CreatedTime <= {TimeRange:end}\r\n\r\n    | parse IncidentUrl with * \"/workspaces/\" Workspace \"/\" *\r\n    | extend Workspace = tolower(Workspace)\r\n\r\n    | extend AlertIdsDyn = todynamic(AlertIds)\r\n\r\n    | extend AlertIdsDyn =\r\n        iff(\r\n            isnull(AlertIdsDyn)\r\n                or array_length(AlertIdsDyn) == 0,\r\n            dynamic([\"\"]),\r\n            AlertIdsDyn\r\n        )\r\n\r\n    | mv-expand AlertId = AlertIdsDyn to typeof(string);\r\n\r\nlet Alerts =\r\n    SecurityAlert\r\n\r\n    | extend AlertDurationMinutes =\r\n        datetime_diff(\r\n            \"second\",\r\n            EndTime,\r\n            StartTime\r\n        ) / 60.0\r\n\r\n    | extend ProductProcessingMinutes =\r\n        datetime_diff(\r\n            \"second\",\r\n            ProcessingEndTime,\r\n            EndTime\r\n        ) / 60.0\r\n\r\n    | extend AlertIngestionTime = ingestion_time()\r\n\r\n    | extend SentinelIngestionMinutes =\r\n        datetime_diff(\r\n            \"second\",\r\n            AlertIngestionTime,\r\n            ProcessingEndTime\r\n        ) / 60.0\r\n\r\n    | project\r\n        SystemAlertId,\r\n        AlertDurationMinutes,\r\n        ProductProcessingMinutes,\r\n        SentinelIngestionMinutes;\r\n\r\nIncidents\r\n\r\n| join kind=leftouter\r\n    Alerts\r\n    on $left.AlertId == $right.SystemAlertId\r\n\r\n| extend IncidentElapsedMinutes =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isnotempty(LastModifiedTime)\r\n            and isnotempty(CreatedTime),\r\n        datetime_diff(\r\n            \"second\",\r\n            LastModifiedTime,\r\n            CreatedTime\r\n        ) / 60.0,\r\n        real(null)\r\n    )\r\n\r\n| summarize\r\n    AlertCount =\r\n        dcountif(\r\n            AlertId,\r\n            AlertId != \"\"\r\n        ),\r\n\r\n    WorstAlertDurationMinutes =\r\n        max(AlertDurationMinutes),\r\n\r\n    WorstProductProcessingMinutes =\r\n        max(ProductProcessingMinutes),\r\n\r\n    WorstSentinelIngestionMinutes =\r\n        max(SentinelIngestionMinutes),\r\n\r\n    arg_max(\r\n        TimeGenerated,\r\n        Workspace,\r\n        Title,\r\n        Severity,\r\n        Status,\r\n        CreatedTime,\r\n        LastModifiedTime,\r\n        IncidentElapsedMinutes,\r\n        IncidentUrl\r\n    )\r\n\r\n  by\r\n    TenantId,\r\n    IncidentNumber\r\n\r\n| extend SeverityDisplay =\r\n    case(\r\n        Severity == \"High\",          \"🔴 P1 - High\",\r\n        Severity == \"Medium\",        \"🟠 P2 - Medium\",\r\n        Severity == \"Low\",           \"🟡 P3 - Low\",\r\n        Severity == \"Informational\", \"🔵 P4 - Informational\",\r\n        Severity\r\n    )\r\n\r\n| extend StatusDisplay =\r\n    case(\r\n        Status == \"New\",    \"🆕 New\",\r\n        Status == \"Active\", \"🔄 Active\",\r\n        Status == \"Closed\", \"✅ Closed\",\r\n        Status\r\n    )\r\n\r\n| project\r\n    Workspace,\r\n    [\"Incident #\"] = IncidentNumber,\r\n    Severity = SeverityDisplay,\r\n    Status = StatusDisplay,\r\n    Title,\r\n    Alerts = AlertCount,\r\n    [\"Product Processing\"] = round(WorstProductProcessingMinutes, 2),\r\n    [\"Sentinel Ingestion\"] = round(WorstSentinelIngestionMinutes, 2),\r\n    [\"Alert Duration\"] = round(WorstAlertDurationMinutes, 2),\r\n    [\"Incident Elapsed\"] = round(IncidentElapsedMinutes, 2),\r\n    Created = CreatedTime,\r\n    [\"Last Modified\"] = LastModifiedTime,\r\n    Open = IncidentUrl\r\n\r\n| order by [\"Product Processing\"] desc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "Latency Investigation Data",
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ]
            },
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "hide",
              "comparison": "isEqualTo",
              "value": "hide"
            },
            "name": "query - Latency Investigation Data"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### 🧪 Alert Processing Diagnostic\r\n💡 Select an incident row below to investigate its alert-level processing and ingestion latency."
            },
            "name": "text - 5"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "{\"version\":\"Merge/1.0\",\"merges\":[{\"id\":\"latency-customer-merge\",\"mergeType\":\"innerunique\",\"leftTable\":\"query - Latency Customer Context\",\"rightTable\":\"query - Latency Investigation Data\",\"leftColumn\":\"Workspace\",\"rightColumn\":\"Workspace\"}],\"projectRename\":[{\"originalName\":\"[query - Latency Customer Context].Customer\",\"mergedName\":\"Customer\",\"fromId\":\"latency-customer-merge\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Latency Investigation Data].Workspace\",\"mergedName\":\"Workspace\",\"fromId\":\"latency-customer-merge\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Latency Investigation Data].Incident #\",\"mergedName\":\"Incident #\",\"fromId\":\"latency-customer-merge\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Latency Investigation Data].Severity\",\"mergedName\":\"Severity\",\"fromId\":\"latency-customer-merge\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Latency Investigation Data].Status\",\"mergedName\":\"Status\",\"fromId\":\"latency-customer-merge\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Latency Investigation Data].Title\",\"mergedName\":\"Title\",\"fromId\":\"latency-customer-merge\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Latency Investigation Data].Alerts\",\"mergedName\":\"Alerts\",\"fromId\":\"latency-customer-merge\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Latency Investigation Data].Product Processing\",\"mergedName\":\"Product Processing\",\"fromId\":\"latency-customer-merge\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Latency Investigation Data].Sentinel Ingestion\",\"mergedName\":\"Sentinel Ingestion\",\"fromId\":\"latency-customer-merge\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Latency Investigation Data].Alert Duration\",\"mergedName\":\"Alert Duration\",\"fromId\":\"latency-customer-merge\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Latency Investigation Data].Incident Elapsed\",\"mergedName\":\"Incident Elapsed\",\"fromId\":\"latency-customer-merge\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Latency Investigation Data].Created\",\"mergedName\":\"Created\",\"fromId\":\"latency-customer-merge\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Latency Investigation Data].Last Modified\",\"mergedName\":\"Last Modified\",\"fromId\":\"latency-customer-merge\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Latency Investigation Data].Open\",\"mergedName\":\"Open\",\"fromId\":\"latency-customer-merge\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Latency Customer Context].WorkspaceResourceId\",\"mergedName\":\"Workspace Resource ID\",\"fromId\":\"latency-customer-merge\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Latency Customer Context].Workspace\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Latency Customer Context].subscriptionId\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Latency Customer Context].resourceGroup\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Latency Customer Context].location\"},{\"originalName\":\"[query - Latency Customer Context].tenantId\"}]}",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "🔎 Latency Investigation — Worst Incidents — {TimeRange:label}",
              "exportedParameters": [
                {
                  "fieldName": "Customer",
                  "parameterName": "LatencyCustomer",
                  "parameterType": 1
                },
                {
                  "fieldName": "Workspace",
                  "parameterName": "LatencyWorkspace",
                  "parameterType": 1
                },
                {
                  "fieldName": "Workspace Resource ID",
                  "parameterName": "LatencyWorkspaceResourceId",
                  "parameterType": 1
                },
                {
                  "fieldName": "Incident #",
                  "parameterName": "LatencyIncidentNumber",
                  "parameterType": 1
                }
              ],
              "showExportToExcel": true,
              "queryType": 7,
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Customer",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "220px"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Workspace",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "220px"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Product Processing",
                    "formatter": 8,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "greenRed"
                    },
                    "numberFormat": {
                      "unit": 25,
                      "options": {
                        "style": "decimal",
                        "maximumFractionDigits": 2
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Sentinel Ingestion",
                    "formatter": 8,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "greenRed"
                    },
                    "numberFormat": {
                      "unit": 25,
                      "options": {
                        "style": "decimal",
                        "maximumFractionDigits": 2
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Alert Duration",
                    "formatter": 8,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "whiteBlack"
                    },
                    "numberFormat": {
                      "unit": 25,
                      "options": {
                        "style": "decimal",
                        "maximumFractionDigits": 2
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Incident Elapsed",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "numberFormat": {
                      "unit": 25,
                      "options": {
                        "style": "decimal",
                        "maximumFractionDigits": 2
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Workspace Resource ID",
                    "formatter": 5
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Open",
                    "formatter": 1,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "linkTarget": "Url",
                      "linkLabel": "Open in Microsoft Sentinel"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "rowLimit": 2000,
                "filter": true,
                "hierarchySettings": {
                  "treeType": 1,
                  "groupBy": [
                    "Severity"
                  ],
                  "expandTopLevel": false
                }
              },
              "sortBy": []
            },
            "name": "query - Latency Investigation"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### 🧪 Alert Processing Diagnostic\r\n\r\n**Alert Duration** measures the alert's detection or event window (`Start → End`). A long Alert Duration does not by itself indicate an ingestion problem.\r\n\r\n**Product Processing** measures `Alert End → Processing End`. A high value indicates that the alert-producing product took longer to finish processing after the alert window ended. This occurs before Microsoft Sentinel / Log Analytics ingestion.\r\n\r\n**Sentinel Ingestion** measures `Processing End → Log Analytics ingestion`. A high value indicates delay after product processing completed and before the alert became available in Log Analytics.\r\n\r\nThe diagnostic report shows each alert separately, so an outlier such as **52 minutes Product Processing** can be traced to the exact alert and timestamps responsible.\r\n\r\n⚠️ Diagnostic labels use a 10-minute marker only to highlight which stage warrants investigation first. It is an investigation aid, **not an SLA threshold**.\r\n\r\n📖 **Microsoft reference:** `EndTime` represents the last event/activity included in an alert, while `ProcessingEndTime` represents when the originating product completes production of the alert. Sentinel Central derives **Product Processing** as `EndTime → ProcessingEndTime`.\r\n\r\n[Microsoft Sentinel security alert schema reference](https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/sentinel/security-alert-schema)"
            },
            "conditionalVisibilities": [
              {
                "parameterName": "LatencyIncidentNumber",
                "comparison": "isNotEqualTo",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "parameterName": "LatencyWorkspaceResourceId",
                "comparison": "isNotEqualTo",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "name": "text - Latency Diagnostic Guidance"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "// ======================================================================\r\n// Sentinel Central - Incident Alert Latency Diagnostic\r\n//\r\n// Drill-down from Latency Investigation.\r\n// Shows every SecurityAlert associated with the selected incident and\r\n// exposes the timestamps used to calculate each latency stage.\r\n// ======================================================================\r\n\r\nlet SelectedIncident =\r\n    SecurityIncident\r\n\r\n    | summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by TenantId, IncidentNumber\r\n\r\n    | where IncidentNumber == tolong(\"{LatencyIncidentNumber}\")\r\n\r\n    | extend AlertIdsDyn = todynamic(AlertIds)\r\n    | mv-expand AlertId = AlertIdsDyn to typeof(string)\r\n\r\n    | where isnotempty(AlertId)\r\n\r\n    | project\r\n        IncidentNumber,\r\n        IncidentTitle = Title,\r\n        IncidentSeverity = Severity,\r\n        IncidentStatus = Status,\r\n        IncidentCreated = CreatedTime,\r\n        IncidentLastModified = LastModifiedTime,\r\n        IncidentUrl,\r\n        AlertId;\r\n\r\nlet AlertDetails =\r\n    SecurityAlert\r\n\r\n    | extend AlertIngestionTime = ingestion_time()\r\n\r\n    // Detection/event window.\r\n    | extend AlertDurationMinutes =\r\n        iff(\r\n            isnotempty(StartTime)\r\n                and isnotempty(EndTime),\r\n            datetime_diff(\r\n                \"second\",\r\n                EndTime,\r\n                StartTime\r\n            ) / 60.0,\r\n            real(null)\r\n        )\r\n\r\n    // Alert End -> Product Processing End.\r\n    | extend ProductProcessingMinutes =\r\n        iff(\r\n            isnotempty(EndTime)\r\n                and isnotempty(ProcessingEndTime),\r\n            datetime_diff(\r\n                \"second\",\r\n                ProcessingEndTime,\r\n                EndTime\r\n            ) / 60.0,\r\n            real(null)\r\n        )\r\n\r\n    // Processing End -> Log Analytics ingestion.\r\n    | extend SentinelIngestionMinutes =\r\n        iff(\r\n            isnotempty(ProcessingEndTime)\r\n                and isnotempty(AlertIngestionTime),\r\n            datetime_diff(\r\n                \"second\",\r\n                AlertIngestionTime,\r\n                ProcessingEndTime\r\n            ) / 60.0,\r\n            real(null)\r\n        )\r\n\r\n    | project\r\n        SystemAlertId,\r\n        AlertName,\r\n        ProductName,\r\n        ProviderName,\r\n        VendorName,\r\n        StartTime,\r\n        EndTime,\r\n        ProcessingEndTime,\r\n        AlertIngestionTime,\r\n        AlertDurationMinutes,\r\n        ProductProcessingMinutes,\r\n        SentinelIngestionMinutes;\r\n\r\nSelectedIncident\r\n\r\n| join kind=leftouter\r\n    AlertDetails\r\n    on $left.AlertId == $right.SystemAlertId\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// DIAGNOSTIC CLASSIFICATION\r\n//\r\n// Investigation aid only. These are NOT SLA thresholds.\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend Diagnostic =\r\n    case(\r\n        isnull(ProductProcessingMinutes)\r\n            and isnull(SentinelIngestionMinutes),\r\n            \"⚪ Timing unavailable\",\r\n\r\n        ProductProcessingMinutes >= 10\r\n            and (\r\n                isnull(SentinelIngestionMinutes)\r\n                or ProductProcessingMinutes >= SentinelIngestionMinutes\r\n            ),\r\n            \"⚠️ Product processing\",\r\n\r\n        SentinelIngestionMinutes >= 10\r\n            and (\r\n                isnull(ProductProcessingMinutes)\r\n                or SentinelIngestionMinutes > ProductProcessingMinutes\r\n            ),\r\n            \"⚠️ Sentinel ingestion\",\r\n\r\n        \"🟢 No large processing delay\"\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// FRIENDLY PRODUCT\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend Product =\r\n    case(\r\n        ProductName == \"Microsoft Cloud App Security\",\r\n            \"Microsoft Defender for Cloud Apps\",\r\n        ProductName == \"Microsoft Defender Advanced Threat Protection\",\r\n            \"Microsoft Defender for Endpoint\",\r\n        ProductName == \"Office 365 Advanced Threat Protection\",\r\n            \"Microsoft Defender for Office 365\",\r\n        ProductName == \"Azure Advanced Threat Protection\",\r\n            \"Microsoft Defender for Identity\",\r\n        ProductName == \"Azure Sentinel\",\r\n            \"Microsoft Sentinel\",\r\n        ProductName\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// FINAL OUTPUT\r\n// ----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| project\r\n    Diagnostic,\r\n    Alert = AlertName,\r\n    Product,\r\n    Provider = ProviderName,\r\n    [\"Alert Start\"] = StartTime,\r\n    [\"Alert End\"] = EndTime,\r\n    [\"Processing End\"] = ProcessingEndTime,\r\n    Ingested = AlertIngestionTime,\r\n    [\"Alert Duration\"] = round(AlertDurationMinutes, 2),\r\n    [\"Product Processing\"] = round(ProductProcessingMinutes, 2),\r\n    [\"Sentinel Ingestion\"] = round(SentinelIngestionMinutes, 2),\r\n    [\"Alert ID\"] = AlertId\r\n\r\n| order by [\"Product Processing\"] desc nulls last",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "🧪 Latency Diagnostic — {LatencyCustomer} — {LatencyWorkspace} — Incident {LatencyIncidentNumber}",
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "showExportToExcel": true,
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{LatencyWorkspaceResourceId}"
              ],
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Diagnostic",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "190px"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Alert",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "320px"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Product",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "220px"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Provider",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "180px"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Alert Duration",
                    "formatter": 8,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "whiteBlack"
                    },
                    "numberFormat": {
                      "unit": 25,
                      "options": {
                        "style": "decimal",
                        "maximumFractionDigits": 2
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Product Processing",
                    "formatter": 8,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "greenRed"
                    },
                    "numberFormat": {
                      "unit": 25,
                      "options": {
                        "style": "decimal",
                        "maximumFractionDigits": 2
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Sentinel Ingestion",
                    "formatter": 8,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "greenRed"
                    },
                    "numberFormat": {
                      "unit": 25,
                      "options": {
                        "style": "decimal",
                        "maximumFractionDigits": 2
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "Alert ID",
                    "formatter": 7,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "linkTarget": "CellDetails",
                      "linkLabel": "View ID",
                      "linkIsContextBlade": true
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "rowLimit": 500,
                "filter": true
              },
              "sortBy": []
            },
            "conditionalVisibilities": [
              {
                "parameterName": "LatencyIncidentNumber",
                "comparison": "isNotEqualTo",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "parameterName": "LatencyWorkspaceResourceId",
                "comparison": "isNotEqualTo",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "name": "query - Latency Alert Diagnostic"
          }
        ]
      },
      "name": "group - Latency Investigation"
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "title": "Group: SOC",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "🛡️ SOC SLA Performance — Rolling 90-Day Review\r\n\r\nReview SLA performance for incidents closed during the last 90 days. See overall compliance, compare performance by severity, understand the impact of SLA breaches, and identify the incidents responsible.\r\n\r\nSLA targets are configurable below. The global Workspace selection above controls which Sentinel workspaces are included in the review.\r\n",
              "style": "info"
            },
            "name": "text - 15"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "## 🛡️ SOC Reporting — Rolling 90-Day SLA Review\r\n\r\nSOC Reporting provides a consistent **rolling 90-day review of incidents closed during the period** across the Microsoft Sentinel workspaces selected at the top of Sentinel Central.\r\n\r\n### ⚙️ SLA Targets\r\n\r\nConfigure the SLA target for each severity in **hours**.\r\n\r\n* 🔴 **High (P1):** 1 hour by default\r\n* 🟠 **Medium (P2):** 8 hours by default\r\n* 🟡 **Low (P3):** 24 hours by default\r\n* 🔵 **Informational:** Optional\r\n\r\nLeave the Informational SLA blank to exclude Informational incidents from SLA calculations.\r\n\r\nUse the **Severity** selector to analyse P1–P3 together or focus on an individual severity.\r\n\r\n> The SOC report always uses incidents **closed during the last 90 days**. It does not use the global Time Range selector. The global Workspace selection still controls which Sentinel workspaces are included.\r\n\r\n### 🎯 90-Day SLA Performance Summary\r\n\r\nProvides the headline SLA position across the selected workspaces:\r\n\r\n* Closed Incidents\r\n* Met SLA\r\n* Breached SLA\r\n* SLA Compliance\r\n* Breach Rate\r\n\r\n**SLA Compliance** is the percentage of closed incidents resolved within their configured severity SLA.\r\n\r\n### 📊 SLA Performance by Severity\r\n\r\nBreaks SLA performance down by severity and shows:\r\n\r\n* SLA target\r\n* Incident volume\r\n* Incidents meeting SLA\r\n* Incidents breaching SLA\r\n* SLA compliance percentage\r\n* Median Time to Resolve\r\n* P90 Time to Resolve\r\n\r\n**Median TTR** represents typical resolution performance.\r\n\r\n**P90 TTR** shows the slower end of incident handling and helps expose long-running incidents that may not be obvious from the median alone.\r\n\r\n### ⏱️ SLA Breach Impact\r\n\r\nLooks only at incidents that breached SLA and measures **how far beyond SLA they were resolved**.\r\n\r\nThe report shows:\r\n\r\n* Number of breached incidents\r\n* Median SLA overrun\r\n* P90 SLA overrun\r\n* Worst SLA breach\r\n\r\nThis helps distinguish between frequent small SLA misses and incidents that remained unresolved for significantly longer than their target.\r\n\r\n### 🔎 SLA Breach Investigation\r\n\r\nProvides the incident-level detail behind the SLA breaches.\r\n\r\nResults are grouped by **Workspace and Severity** and include:\r\n\r\n* Incident number\r\n* Severity\r\n* Title\r\n* Owner\r\n* Classification\r\n* Created and closed times\r\n* SLA target\r\n* Time to Resolve\r\n* SLA overrun\r\n* Direct Microsoft Sentinel incident link\r\n\r\nResults are ordered by the largest SLA overrun, making it easier to identify the incidents having the greatest impact on SLA performance.\r\n\r\n### 📌 How to Read the Report\r\n\r\nUse the four sections together:\r\n\r\n**🎯 Overall Performance** → Are we meeting SLA?\r\n\r\n**📊 Severity Performance** → Where are SLA issues occurring?\r\n\r\n**⏱️ Breach Impact** → How significant are the SLA misses?\r\n\r\n**🔎 Incident Investigation** → Which incidents caused them?\r\n",
              "style": "info"
            },
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "Help",
              "comparison": "isEqualTo",
              "value": "Yes"
            },
            "name": "text - 15 - Copy"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "#### ⚙️ Define your SOC SLA targets"
            },
            "name": "text - 6"
          },
          {
            "type": 9,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
              "parameters": [
                {
                  "id": "1ee145ba-6384-48b5-b501-0d977832c21a",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "slaHigh",
                  "label": "🔴 High SLA (hrs)",
                  "type": 1,
                  "value": "1",
                  "timeContext": {
                    "durationMs": 86400000
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "3b148959-329b-4d65-bbe2-aa6ac48d3f48",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "slaMedium",
                  "label": "🟠 Medium SLA (hrs)",
                  "type": 1,
                  "value": "8",
                  "timeContext": {
                    "durationMs": 86400000
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "d59c2800-d4df-4695-a5ac-a3ea00232a59",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "slaLow",
                  "label": "🟡 Low SLA (hrs)",
                  "type": 1,
                  "value": "24",
                  "timeContext": {
                    "durationMs": 86400000
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "b96aee49-14e6-4e52-bb27-1aaa0264df73",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "slaInfo",
                  "label": "🔵 Informational SLA (hrs)",
                  "type": 1,
                  "value": "",
                  "timeContext": {
                    "durationMs": 86400000
                  }
                }
              ],
              "style": "pills",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
            },
            "name": "parameters - SOC SLA Targets"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "High, Medium and Low default to 1h, 8h and 24h. Leave Informational blank to exclude it from SLA calculations."
            },
            "name": "text - 13"
          },
          {
            "type": 9,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
              "parameters": [
                {
                  "id": "da1cf0b1-f99f-4c9f-8f31-264996c1a446",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "selectSeverity",
                  "label": "🎚️ Severity",
                  "type": 10,
                  "isRequired": true,
                  "typeSettings": {
                    "additionalResourceOptions": [],
                    "showDefault": false
                  },
                  "jsonData": "[\r\n { \"value\": \"'Low','Medium','High'\", \"label\": \"P1, P2 & P3\", \"selected\": true },\r\n { \"value\": \"'High'\", \"label\": \"🔴 High (P1)\" },\r\n { \"value\": \"'Medium'\", \"label\": \"🟠 Medium (P2)\" },\r\n { \"value\": \"'Low'\", \"label\": \"🟡 Low (P3)\" },\r\n { \"value\": \"'Informational'\", \"label\": \"🔵 Informational\" },\r\n { \"value\": \"'Informational','Low','Medium','High'\", \"label\": \"All Severities\" }\r\n]",
                  "timeContext": {
                    "durationMs": 86400000
                  }
                }
              ],
              "style": "above",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
            },
            "name": "parameters - SOC Severity"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "// Sentinel Central - SOC Reporting\r\n// Rolling 90-Day SLA Performance Summary\r\n//\r\n// Purpose:\r\n// Headline SLA metrics for incidents CLOSED during\r\n// the rolling 90-day SOC review period.\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// SLA TARGETS\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nlet SLA_High =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isempty(trim(\" \", \"{slaHigh}\")),\r\n        60.0,\r\n        toreal(\"{slaHigh}\") * 60.0\r\n    );\r\n\r\nlet SLA_Medium =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isempty(trim(\" \", \"{slaMedium}\")),\r\n        480.0,\r\n        toreal(\"{slaMedium}\") * 60.0\r\n    );\r\n\r\nlet SLA_Low =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isempty(trim(\" \", \"{slaLow}\")),\r\n        1440.0,\r\n        toreal(\"{slaLow}\") * 60.0\r\n    );\r\n\r\nlet SLA_Info =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isempty(trim(\" \", \"{slaInfo}\")),\r\n        real(null),\r\n        toreal(\"{slaInfo}\") * 60.0\r\n    );\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// REVIEW PERIOD\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n// SOC Reporting intentionally uses a fixed rolling 90-day review.\r\nlet lookback = 90d;\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// INCIDENT POPULATION\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nlet SLAResults =\r\n    SecurityIncident\r\n\r\n    // SecurityIncident contains multiple versions of an incident.\r\n    // Keep the latest available record for each incident.\r\n    | summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by IncidentNumber\r\n\r\n    // SLA reporting is based on incidents CLOSED in the last 90 days.\r\n    | where Status == \"Closed\"\r\n    | where isnotempty(CreatedTime)\r\n        and isnotempty(ClosedTime)\r\n    | where ClosedTime >= ago(lookback)\r\n\r\n    // Apply the SOC severity selector.\r\n    | where Severity in ({selectSeverity})\r\n\r\n    // Calculate Time to Resolve in minutes.\r\n    | extend TTR_Minutes =\r\n        todouble(\r\n            datetime_diff(\r\n                \"minute\",\r\n                ClosedTime,\r\n                CreatedTime\r\n            )\r\n        )\r\n\r\n    // Remove invalid negative durations.\r\n    | where TTR_Minutes >= 0\r\n\r\n    // Assign the configured SLA according to severity.\r\n    | extend SLA_Minutes =\r\n        case(\r\n            Severity == \"High\",          SLA_High,\r\n            Severity == \"Medium\",        SLA_Medium,\r\n            Severity == \"Low\",           SLA_Low,\r\n            Severity == \"Informational\", SLA_Info,\r\n            real(null)\r\n        )\r\n\r\n    // Only include severities with an SLA target.\r\n    | where isnotnull(SLA_Minutes)\r\n\r\n    // Determine whether the incident breached SLA.\r\n    | extend SLA_Breached =\r\n        TTR_Minutes > SLA_Minutes;\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// SLA SUMMARY\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nlet SLASummary =\r\n    SLAResults\r\n    | summarize\r\n        ClosedIncidents = count(),\r\n        MetSLA          = countif(not(SLA_Breached)),\r\n        BreachedSLA     = countif(SLA_Breached)\r\n\r\n    | extend\r\n        SLACompliance =\r\n            iff(\r\n                ClosedIncidents > 0,\r\n                round(\r\n                    100.0 * MetSLA / ClosedIncidents,\r\n                    1\r\n                ),\r\n                0.0\r\n            ),\r\n\r\n        SLABreachRate =\r\n            iff(\r\n                ClosedIncidents > 0,\r\n                round(\r\n                    100.0 * BreachedSLA / ClosedIncidents,\r\n                    1\r\n                ),\r\n                0.0\r\n            );\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// TILE OUTPUT\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nSLASummary\r\n\r\n| project Metric = pack_array(\r\n\r\n    pack(\r\n        \"Order\", 1,\r\n        \"Icon\", \"📋\",\r\n        \"Metric\", \"Closed Incidents\",\r\n        \"Value\", tostring(ClosedIncidents)\r\n    ),\r\n\r\n    pack(\r\n        \"Order\", 2,\r\n        \"Icon\", \"✅\",\r\n        \"Metric\", \"Met SLA\",\r\n        \"Value\", tostring(MetSLA)\r\n    ),\r\n\r\n    pack(\r\n        \"Order\", 3,\r\n        \"Icon\", \"🚨\",\r\n        \"Metric\", \"Breached SLA\",\r\n        \"Value\", tostring(BreachedSLA)\r\n    ),\r\n\r\n    pack(\r\n        \"Order\", 4,\r\n        \"Icon\", \"🎯\",\r\n        \"Metric\", \"SLA Compliance\",\r\n        \"Value\", strcat(\r\n            tostring(SLACompliance),\r\n            \"%\"\r\n        )\r\n    ),\r\n\r\n    pack(\r\n        \"Order\", 5,\r\n        \"Icon\", \"⚠️\",\r\n        \"Metric\", \"Breach Rate\",\r\n        \"Value\", strcat(\r\n            tostring(SLABreachRate),\r\n            \"%\"\r\n        )\r\n    )\r\n)\r\n\r\n| mv-expand Metric\r\n\r\n| project\r\n    Order  = toint(Metric.Order),\r\n    Icon   = tostring(Metric.Icon),\r\n    Metric = tostring(Metric.Metric),\r\n    Value  = tostring(Metric.Value)\r\n\r\n| order by Order asc",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "90-Day SLA Performance Summary",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "tileSettings": {
                "titleContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Metric",
                  "formatter": 1
                },
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Value",
                  "formatter": 12,
                  "formatOptions": {
                    "palette": "auto"
                  },
                  "numberFormat": {
                    "unit": 17,
                    "options": {
                      "style": "decimal",
                      "maximumFractionDigits": 2,
                      "maximumSignificantDigits": 3
                    }
                  }
                },
                "secondaryContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Icon"
                },
                "showBorder": false
              }
            },
            "name": "query - 8"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "SLA performance for incidents closed during the rolling 90-day review. Compliance shows the percentage resolved within the configured severity SLA targets"
            },
            "name": "text - 9"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "// Sentinel Central - SOC Reporting\r\n// SLA Performance by Severity\r\n//\r\n// Purpose:\r\n// Compare SLA performance and resolution times by severity\r\n// for incidents CLOSED during the rolling 90-day review.\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// SLA TARGETS\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nlet SLA_High =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isempty(trim(\" \", \"{slaHigh}\")),\r\n        60.0,\r\n        toreal(\"{slaHigh}\") * 60.0\r\n    );\r\n\r\nlet SLA_Medium =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isempty(trim(\" \", \"{slaMedium}\")),\r\n        480.0,\r\n        toreal(\"{slaMedium}\") * 60.0\r\n    );\r\n\r\nlet SLA_Low =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isempty(trim(\" \", \"{slaLow}\")),\r\n        1440.0,\r\n        toreal(\"{slaLow}\") * 60.0\r\n    );\r\n\r\nlet SLA_Info =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isempty(trim(\" \", \"{slaInfo}\")),\r\n        real(null),\r\n        toreal(\"{slaInfo}\") * 60.0\r\n    );\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// REVIEW PERIOD\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nlet lookback = 90d;\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// INCIDENT POPULATION\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nSecurityIncident\r\n\r\n// Keep the latest available version of each incident.\r\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by IncidentNumber\r\n\r\n// Only incidents closed during the rolling 90-day review.\r\n| where Status == \"Closed\"\r\n| where isnotempty(CreatedTime)\r\n    and isnotempty(ClosedTime)\r\n| where ClosedTime >= ago(lookback)\r\n\r\n// Apply the SOC severity selector.\r\n| where Severity in ({selectSeverity})\r\n\r\n// Calculate Time to Resolve.\r\n| extend TTR_Minutes =\r\n    todouble(\r\n        datetime_diff(\r\n            \"minute\",\r\n            ClosedTime,\r\n            CreatedTime\r\n        )\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// Remove invalid durations.\r\n| where TTR_Minutes >= 0\r\n\r\n// Assign configured SLA target.\r\n| extend SLA_Minutes =\r\n    case(\r\n        Severity == \"High\",          SLA_High,\r\n        Severity == \"Medium\",        SLA_Medium,\r\n        Severity == \"Low\",           SLA_Low,\r\n        Severity == \"Informational\", SLA_Info,\r\n        real(null)\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// Only include severities with a configured SLA.\r\n| where isnotnull(SLA_Minutes)\r\n\r\n// Determine SLA result.\r\n| extend SLA_Breached =\r\n    TTR_Minutes > SLA_Minutes\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// PERFORMANCE BY SEVERITY\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| summarize\r\n    Incidents   = count(),\r\n    MetSLA      = countif(not(SLA_Breached)),\r\n    BreachedSLA = countif(SLA_Breached),\r\n    MedianTTR   = percentile(TTR_Minutes, 50),\r\n    P90TTR      = percentile(TTR_Minutes, 90)\r\n  by Severity, SLA_Minutes\r\n\r\n// Calculate compliance.\r\n| extend SLACompliance =\r\n    iff(\r\n        Incidents > 0,\r\n        round(\r\n            100.0 * MetSLA / Incidents,\r\n            1\r\n        ),\r\n        0.0\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// FRIENDLY SLA TARGET\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n// SLA is configured in hours, so display it as hours/days\r\n// rather than a plain number.\r\n\r\n| extend SLA_Hours = SLA_Minutes / 60.0\r\n\r\n| extend SLATarget =\r\n    case(\r\n        SLA_Hours >= 24 and SLA_Hours % 24 == 0,\r\n            strcat(\r\n                toint(SLA_Hours / 24),\r\n                \"d\"\r\n            ),\r\n\r\n        SLA_Hours >= 1,\r\n            strcat(\r\n                round(SLA_Hours, 1),\r\n                \"h\"\r\n            ),\r\n\r\n        strcat(\r\n            toint(SLA_Minutes),\r\n            \"m\"\r\n        )\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// FRIENDLY MEDIAN TTR\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend\r\n    MedianDays =\r\n        toint(MedianTTR / 1440),\r\n\r\n    MedianHours =\r\n        toint((MedianTTR % 1440) / 60),\r\n\r\n    MedianMinutes =\r\n        toint(MedianTTR % 60)\r\n\r\n| extend MedianTTRDisplay =\r\n    case(\r\n        MedianDays > 0,\r\n            strcat(\r\n                MedianDays, \"d \",\r\n                MedianHours, \"h \",\r\n                MedianMinutes, \"m\"\r\n            ),\r\n\r\n        MedianHours > 0,\r\n            strcat(\r\n                MedianHours, \"h \",\r\n                MedianMinutes, \"m\"\r\n            ),\r\n\r\n        strcat(\r\n            MedianMinutes, \"m\"\r\n        )\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// FRIENDLY P90 TTR\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend\r\n    P90Days =\r\n        toint(P90TTR / 1440),\r\n\r\n    P90Hours =\r\n        toint((P90TTR % 1440) / 60),\r\n\r\n    P90Minutes =\r\n        toint(P90TTR % 60)\r\n\r\n| extend P90TTRDisplay =\r\n    case(\r\n        P90Days > 0,\r\n            strcat(\r\n                P90Days, \"d \",\r\n                P90Hours, \"h \",\r\n                P90Minutes, \"m\"\r\n            ),\r\n\r\n        P90Hours > 0,\r\n            strcat(\r\n                P90Hours, \"h \",\r\n                P90Minutes, \"m\"\r\n            ),\r\n\r\n        strcat(\r\n            P90Minutes, \"m\"\r\n        )\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// PRESENTATION\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend SeverityDisplay =\r\n    case(\r\n        Severity == \"High\",          \"🔴 High\",\r\n        Severity == \"Medium\",        \"🟠 Medium\",\r\n        Severity == \"Low\",           \"🟡 Low\",\r\n        Severity == \"Informational\", \"🔵 Informational\",\r\n        Severity\r\n    )\r\n\r\n| extend SeverityOrder =\r\n    case(\r\n        Severity == \"High\",          1,\r\n        Severity == \"Medium\",        2,\r\n        Severity == \"Low\",           3,\r\n        Severity == \"Informational\", 4,\r\n        5\r\n    )\r\n\r\n| order by SeverityOrder asc\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// FINAL OUTPUT\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| project\r\n    Severity = SeverityDisplay,\r\n    [\"SLA Target\"] = SLATarget,\r\n    Incidents,\r\n    [\"Met SLA\"] = MetSLA,\r\n    [\"Breached SLA\"] = BreachedSLA,\r\n    [\"SLA Compliance %\"] = SLACompliance,\r\n    [\"Median TTR\"] = MedianTTRDisplay,\r\n    [\"P90 TTR\"] = P90TTRDisplay",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "SLA Performance by Severity — Rolling 90 Days",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "tileSettings": {
                "titleContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Metric",
                  "formatter": 1
                },
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Value",
                  "formatter": 12,
                  "formatOptions": {
                    "palette": "auto"
                  },
                  "numberFormat": {
                    "unit": 17,
                    "options": {
                      "style": "decimal",
                      "maximumFractionDigits": 2,
                      "maximumSignificantDigits": 3
                    }
                  }
                },
                "secondaryContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Icon"
                },
                "showBorder": false
              }
            },
            "name": "query - SLA Performance by Severity"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "SLA performance by incident severity. Compare incident volume, SLA compliance and resolution times against the configured severity targets. Median shows typical resolution time, while P90 highlights slower incidents and potential tail-risk."
            },
            "name": "text - 11"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "// Sentinel Central - SOC Reporting\r\n// SLA Breach Impact\r\n//\r\n// Purpose:\r\n// Measure HOW FAR breached incidents exceeded their SLA\r\n// for incidents CLOSED during the rolling 90-day review.\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// SLA TARGETS\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nlet SLA_High =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isempty(trim(\" \", \"{slaHigh}\")),\r\n        60.0,\r\n        toreal(\"{slaHigh}\") * 60.0\r\n    );\r\n\r\nlet SLA_Medium =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isempty(trim(\" \", \"{slaMedium}\")),\r\n        480.0,\r\n        toreal(\"{slaMedium}\") * 60.0\r\n    );\r\n\r\nlet SLA_Low =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isempty(trim(\" \", \"{slaLow}\")),\r\n        1440.0,\r\n        toreal(\"{slaLow}\") * 60.0\r\n    );\r\n\r\nlet SLA_Info =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isempty(trim(\" \", \"{slaInfo}\")),\r\n        real(null),\r\n        toreal(\"{slaInfo}\") * 60.0\r\n    );\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// REVIEW PERIOD\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nlet lookback = 90d;\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// INCIDENT POPULATION\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nSecurityIncident\r\n\r\n// Keep the latest available version of each incident.\r\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by IncidentNumber\r\n\r\n// Only incidents closed during the rolling 90-day review.\r\n| where Status == \"Closed\"\r\n| where isnotempty(CreatedTime)\r\n    and isnotempty(ClosedTime)\r\n| where ClosedTime >= ago(lookback)\r\n\r\n// Apply SOC severity selection.\r\n| where Severity in ({selectSeverity})\r\n\r\n// Calculate Time to Resolve.\r\n| extend TTR_Minutes =\r\n    todouble(\r\n        datetime_diff(\r\n            \"minute\",\r\n            ClosedTime,\r\n            CreatedTime\r\n        )\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// Remove invalid durations.\r\n| where TTR_Minutes >= 0\r\n\r\n// Assign SLA target.\r\n| extend SLA_Minutes =\r\n    case(\r\n        Severity == \"High\",          SLA_High,\r\n        Severity == \"Medium\",        SLA_Medium,\r\n        Severity == \"Low\",           SLA_Low,\r\n        Severity == \"Informational\", SLA_Info,\r\n        real(null)\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// Exclude severities without an SLA.\r\n| where isnotnull(SLA_Minutes)\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// SLA BREACH\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend MinutesOverSLA =\r\n    TTR_Minutes - SLA_Minutes\r\n\r\n// Only analyse breached incidents.\r\n| where MinutesOverSLA > 0\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// BREACH IMPACT BY SEVERITY\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| summarize\r\n    BreachedIncidents      = count(),\r\n    MedianOverSLA_Minutes  = percentile(MinutesOverSLA, 50),\r\n    P90OverSLA_Minutes     = percentile(MinutesOverSLA, 90),\r\n    WorstBreach_Minutes    = max(MinutesOverSLA)\r\n  by Severity, SLA_Minutes\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// FRIENDLY SLA TARGET\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n// SLA controls are configured in hours.\r\n// Keep the same representation in the report.\r\n| extend SLATarget =\r\n    strcat(\r\n        tostring(round(SLA_Minutes / 60.0, 1)),\r\n        \"h\"\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// Remove unnecessary .0 where possible.\r\n| extend SLATarget =\r\n    replace_string(\r\n        SLATarget,\r\n        \".0h\",\r\n        \"h\"\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// FRIENDLY MEDIAN BREACH\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend\r\n    MedianDays =\r\n        toint(MedianOverSLA_Minutes / 1440),\r\n\r\n    MedianHours =\r\n        toint((MedianOverSLA_Minutes % 1440) / 60),\r\n\r\n    MedianMinutes =\r\n        toint(MedianOverSLA_Minutes % 60)\r\n\r\n| extend MedianOverSLA =\r\n    case(\r\n        MedianDays > 0,\r\n            strcat(\r\n                MedianDays, \"d \",\r\n                MedianHours, \"h \",\r\n                MedianMinutes, \"m\"\r\n            ),\r\n\r\n        MedianHours > 0,\r\n            strcat(\r\n                MedianHours, \"h \",\r\n                MedianMinutes, \"m\"\r\n            ),\r\n\r\n        strcat(\r\n            MedianMinutes, \"m\"\r\n        )\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// FRIENDLY P90 BREACH\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend\r\n    P90Days =\r\n        toint(P90OverSLA_Minutes / 1440),\r\n\r\n    P90Hours =\r\n        toint((P90OverSLA_Minutes % 1440) / 60),\r\n\r\n    P90Minutes =\r\n        toint(P90OverSLA_Minutes % 60)\r\n\r\n| extend P90OverSLA =\r\n    case(\r\n        P90Days > 0,\r\n            strcat(\r\n                P90Days, \"d \",\r\n                P90Hours, \"h \",\r\n                P90Minutes, \"m\"\r\n            ),\r\n\r\n        P90Hours > 0,\r\n            strcat(\r\n                P90Hours, \"h \",\r\n                P90Minutes, \"m\"\r\n            ),\r\n\r\n        strcat(\r\n            P90Minutes, \"m\"\r\n        )\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// FRIENDLY WORST BREACH\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend\r\n    WorstDays =\r\n        toint(WorstBreach_Minutes / 1440),\r\n\r\n    WorstHours =\r\n        toint((WorstBreach_Minutes % 1440) / 60),\r\n\r\n    WorstMinutes =\r\n        toint(WorstBreach_Minutes % 60)\r\n\r\n| extend WorstBreach =\r\n    case(\r\n        WorstDays > 0,\r\n            strcat(\r\n                WorstDays, \"d \",\r\n                WorstHours, \"h \",\r\n                WorstMinutes, \"m\"\r\n            ),\r\n\r\n        WorstHours > 0,\r\n            strcat(\r\n                WorstHours, \"h \",\r\n                WorstMinutes, \"m\"\r\n            ),\r\n\r\n        strcat(\r\n            WorstMinutes, \"m\"\r\n        )\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// PRESENTATION\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend SeverityDisplay =\r\n    case(\r\n        Severity == \"High\",          \"🔴 High\",\r\n        Severity == \"Medium\",        \"🟠 Medium\",\r\n        Severity == \"Low\",           \"🟡 Low\",\r\n        Severity == \"Informational\", \"🔵 Informational\",\r\n        Severity\r\n    )\r\n\r\n| extend SeverityOrder =\r\n    case(\r\n        Severity == \"High\",          1,\r\n        Severity == \"Medium\",        2,\r\n        Severity == \"Low\",           3,\r\n        Severity == \"Informational\", 4,\r\n        5\r\n    )\r\n\r\n| order by SeverityOrder asc\r\n\r\n| project\r\n    Severity = SeverityDisplay,\r\n    [\"SLA Target\"] = SLATarget,\r\n    [\"Breached Incidents\"] = BreachedIncidents,\r\n    [\"Median Over SLA\"] = MedianOverSLA,\r\n    [\"P90 Over SLA\"] = P90OverSLA,\r\n    [\"Worst Breach\"] = WorstBreach",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "SLA Breach Impact — Rolling 90 Days",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ]
            },
            "name": "query - SLA Breach Impact"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "How far beyond SLA were breached incidents resolved? Median shows the typical SLA overrun, P90 highlights longer-running breaches, and Worst Breach identifies the largest overrun among incidents closed during the rolling 90-day review."
            },
            "name": "text - 13"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "// Sentinel Central - SOC Reporting\r\n// SLA Breach Investigation\r\n//\r\n// Purpose:\r\n// Identify the individual incidents responsible for SLA breaches\r\n// during the fixed rolling 90-day SOC review.\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// SLA TARGETS\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nlet SLA_High =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isempty(trim(\" \", \"{slaHigh}\")),\r\n        60.0,\r\n        toreal(\"{slaHigh}\") * 60.0\r\n    );\r\n\r\nlet SLA_Medium =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isempty(trim(\" \", \"{slaMedium}\")),\r\n        480.0,\r\n        toreal(\"{slaMedium}\") * 60.0\r\n    );\r\n\r\nlet SLA_Low =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isempty(trim(\" \", \"{slaLow}\")),\r\n        1440.0,\r\n        toreal(\"{slaLow}\") * 60.0\r\n    );\r\n\r\nlet SLA_Info =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isempty(trim(\" \", \"{slaInfo}\")),\r\n        real(null),\r\n        toreal(\"{slaInfo}\") * 60.0\r\n    );\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// REVIEW PERIOD\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nlet lookback = 90d;\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// INCIDENT POPULATION\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nSecurityIncident\r\n\r\n// Keep the latest available version of each incident.\r\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by IncidentNumber\r\n\r\n// Only incidents closed during the rolling 90-day review.\r\n| where Status == \"Closed\"\r\n| where isnotempty(CreatedTime)\r\n    and isnotempty(ClosedTime)\r\n| where ClosedTime >= ago(lookback)\r\n\r\n// Apply SOC severity selection.\r\n| where Severity in ({selectSeverity})\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// WORKSPACE\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| parse IncidentUrl\r\n    with * \"/workspaces/\" WorkSpaceName \"/\" *\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// TIME TO RESOLVE\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend TTR_Minutes =\r\n    todouble(\r\n        datetime_diff(\r\n            \"minute\",\r\n            ClosedTime,\r\n            CreatedTime\r\n        )\r\n    )\r\n\r\n| where TTR_Minutes >= 0\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// SLA\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend SLA_Minutes =\r\n    case(\r\n        Severity == \"High\",          SLA_High,\r\n        Severity == \"Medium\",        SLA_Medium,\r\n        Severity == \"Low\",           SLA_Low,\r\n        Severity == \"Informational\", SLA_Info,\r\n        real(null)\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// Ignore severities without a configured SLA.\r\n| where isnotnull(SLA_Minutes)\r\n\r\n// Calculate breach magnitude.\r\n| extend MinutesOverSLA =\r\n    TTR_Minutes - SLA_Minutes\r\n\r\n// Only breached incidents.\r\n| where MinutesOverSLA > 0\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// OWNER\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend OwnerName =\r\n    coalesce(\r\n        tostring(Owner.assignedTo),\r\n        tostring(Owner.email),\r\n        \"Unassigned\"\r\n    )\r\n\r\n| extend OwnerName =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isempty(OwnerName),\r\n        \"Unassigned\",\r\n        OwnerName\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// SLA TARGET DISPLAY\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend SLATarget =\r\n    strcat(\r\n        tostring(round(SLA_Minutes / 60.0, 1)),\r\n        \"h\"\r\n    )\r\n\r\n| extend SLATarget =\r\n    replace_string(\r\n        SLATarget,\r\n        \".0h\",\r\n        \"h\"\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// FRIENDLY TIME TO RESOLVE\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend\r\n    TTRDays =\r\n        toint(TTR_Minutes / 1440),\r\n\r\n    TTRHours =\r\n        toint((TTR_Minutes % 1440) / 60),\r\n\r\n    TTRMinutes =\r\n        toint(TTR_Minutes % 60)\r\n\r\n| extend TimeToResolve =\r\n    case(\r\n        TTRDays > 0,\r\n            strcat(\r\n                TTRDays, \"d \",\r\n                TTRHours, \"h \",\r\n                TTRMinutes, \"m\"\r\n            ),\r\n\r\n        TTRHours > 0,\r\n            strcat(\r\n                TTRHours, \"h \",\r\n                TTRMinutes, \"m\"\r\n            ),\r\n\r\n        strcat(\r\n            TTRMinutes, \"m\"\r\n        )\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// FRIENDLY SLA OVERRUN\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend\r\n    OverDays =\r\n        toint(MinutesOverSLA / 1440),\r\n\r\n    OverHours =\r\n        toint((MinutesOverSLA % 1440) / 60),\r\n\r\n    OverMinutes =\r\n        toint(MinutesOverSLA % 60)\r\n\r\n| extend SLAOverrun =\r\n    case(\r\n        OverDays > 0,\r\n            strcat(\r\n                OverDays, \"d \",\r\n                OverHours, \"h \",\r\n                OverMinutes, \"m\"\r\n            ),\r\n\r\n        OverHours > 0,\r\n            strcat(\r\n                OverHours, \"h \",\r\n                OverMinutes, \"m\"\r\n            ),\r\n\r\n        strcat(\r\n            OverMinutes, \"m\"\r\n        )\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// PRESENTATION\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| extend SeverityDisplay =\r\n    case(\r\n        Severity == \"High\",          \"🔴 High\",\r\n        Severity == \"Medium\",        \"🟠 Medium\",\r\n        Severity == \"Low\",           \"🟡 Low\",\r\n        Severity == \"Informational\", \"🔵 Informational\",\r\n        Severity\r\n    )\r\n\r\n// Sort using the real numeric SLA overrun.\r\n| order by MinutesOverSLA desc\r\n\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n// FINAL OUTPUT\r\n// ------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n| project\r\n    Workspace = WorkSpaceName,\r\n    IncidentNumber,\r\n    Severity = SeverityDisplay,\r\n    Title,\r\n    Owner = OwnerName,\r\n    Classification,\r\n    Created = CreatedTime,\r\n    Closed = ClosedTime,\r\n    [\"SLA Target\"] = SLATarget,\r\n    [\"Time to Resolve\"] = TimeToResolve,\r\n    [\"Over SLA\"] = SLAOverrun,\r\n    IncidentUrl",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "SLA Breach Investigation — Rolling 90 Days",
              "showExportToExcel": true,
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "gridSettings": {
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "$gen_group",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "35ch"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "IncidentUrl",
                    "formatter": 7,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "linkTarget": "Url",
                      "linkLabel": "Microsoft Sentinel"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "$gen_group",
                    "formatter": 0,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "customColumnWidthSetting": "35ch"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "rowLimit": 5000,
                "filter": true,
                "hierarchySettings": {
                  "treeType": 1,
                  "groupBy": [
                    "Workspace",
                    "Severity"
                  ],
                  "expandTopLevel": true
                }
              }
            },
            "name": "query - SLA Breach Investigation"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "Which incidents caused the SLA breaches? Review breached incidents closed during the rolling 90-day period, ordered by the largest SLA overrun. Use the incident link to investigate individual cases in Microsoft Sentinel."
            },
            "name": "text - 15"
          }
        ]
      },
      "conditionalVisibility": {
